--    is no longer an assumption; it is a load-time gate.
-- 10 minor (≡30) manifest ships `git:unbaked` / build-env-coupled — FIXED as
--    far as honesty goes (see X4); the git SHA itself is carried to stage 2.
-- 32 minor round-012 results ledger not committed — FIXED BY THIS FILE.
-- 7  note C1 is not byte-level — ACCEPTED, no code change (the reviewer asked
--    for exactly that): the level is now stated explicitly in E8 above with the
