-- OQ-C3-1 (NEW, recorded in run-migration/OWNER-RULINGS.md): should
--   canonical_state_sha digest the author NAME instead of the interned RANK?
--   Keeping the rank costs nothing now but makes the digest a WITHIN-STORE
--   identity, so a stage-2 cross-backend C3 gate must first prove the author
--   tables are equal. Switching is one line but invalidates every recorded
--   state sha and contradicts the immutable D6.
-- OQ-C3-2 the git SHA in `provenance.converter` (X4): bake it via build.rs
--   (puts git state into every build of the crate) or accept the
--   (input sha, output bytes) reproducibility pair as the store's identity?
