--   here: conflict/5 IS durably materialized, 78 facts in perspective `audit`.
--   OQ-5 DISSOLVED as pre-registered: in the per-key-predicate layout every
--   metadata key is its own predicate, so every Functional subject is plain c0
--   and the attr/3 compound-subject question no longer exists.

